Z||000024||stsmithgt||01-25-2001||04:43 PM||||When you think you're getting screwed... Look again.  I just picked up the collision report and they are recommending to ticket me for failing to yeild to the other vehicle, which lawfully entered the intersection before the light turned red.  <P>        ?????????????????????<BR>If that car was in the intersection, I would have seen it.  All cars were stopped when my light turned green and there wasn't any car unusally poking out into the intersection.  I'm not blind.  I know I would have seen him if he was in the intersection.  He didn't come across until he was behind me out of my view.  Half the cars that pull up to where he was, pull it up into the crosswalk just so they can see what's going on.  I can't believe this.  A guy gets to drive across a large intersection not watching where he's going, gets to plow me off the road and I get ticketed for it and he gets off scott free with no ticket.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif">  I can't believe I'm getting so screwed.||||reg||1
