Z||000034||stsmithgt||02-13-2001||01:31 PM||||While it's off Terry, you can change that wiper switch in there for me. he he  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <BR>Actually my washer squirter thingy isn't operating.  The wipers don't do there 4 wipe thing and the soap doesn't squirt.  I think it is the switch in the column because I got another set of relays that are in the front trunk, from the wrecking yard, and that didn't make a difference.  I ones I messed with are on their bracket, but I haven't remounted the bracket yet.  One <I>more</I> of those things that I need to fix.  I did get a new trunk seal in yesterday though.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>   ||||reg||1
